Inspired by MAT locus synteny figures (e.g. Supplementary to Koenig et al.)

Tracks (top to bottom):
  1. Mucci3    - scaffold_1    [sexP Mucor circinelloides, JGI reference]
  2. mu402     - scaffold_1    [sexP Mucor circinelloides, alt assembly]
