  4. Phybl4    - scaffold_10   [sexM Phycomyces blakesleeanus, JGI reference]
  5. Rarr_CCUG - JBSZQK010000002.1 [Rhizopus arrhizus CCUG61147]
  6. RhiMicr1  - CDSBDI010000001.1 [Rhizopus microsporus var. oligosporus]
"""

